[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=LogBeamOS Software Manager
Name[pt]=Gestor de Programas LogBeamOS
Name[es]=Gestor de Programas LogBeamOS
Name[fr]=Gestionnaire de logiciels LogBeamOS
Comment=Search, install and remove programs: amateur radio first, and all the other software
Comment[pt]=Procurar, instalar e remover programas: os de radioamador primeiro, e todo o outro software
Comment[es]=Buscar, instalar y eliminar programas: los de radioaficionado primero, y todo el demás software
Comment[fr]=Rechercher, installer et supprimer des logiciels : la radio d'abord, puis tous les autres
Keywords=software;install;remove;programs;flatpak;apt;programas;instalar;remover;logiciels;
Exec=logbeamos-programas %U
Icon=/usr/share/logbeamos/programas.png
Terminal=false
Categories=HamRadio;System;PackageManager;
